# Verbatim canon text is materialized in the committed RDF (the M layer) — see AGENTS.md;
# non-distribution is enforced at the View layer, not by gitignore.
# sources/private/ is reserved for genuinely-confidential source snapshots (e.g. sponsor docs, v0.2).
/sources/private/

